  "sourceTitle": "Let small local models write both the tests and the code. The tests rejected a known-correct solution 77% of the time",
  "sourceBodyHash": "0ed3fccdd24b68e635bab61d479023a32860b53ef25fe85a0592fa69e831f9e2",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
